5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like to live next to these things! I'll look into the visit to the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think it's important to understand the costs involved so we can be fair to everyone. I'll look into the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're all neighbors here, I'm curious about the history of the friction. I'll check the ward complaint log for this point and the station block's meeting minutes to see how they handled their disputes.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know how much work this actually takes. I'll look into the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the statements at the residents' meeting to see who's actually willing to help.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to ensure the burden is distributed fairly. I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Does anyone else feel we should check the residents' meeting statements? I'm worried about how we'll split the costs, but knowing people's attitudes might help us find a balanced solution.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, May is already covering the statements. I think we have a good spread of information. Let's see what we find before we start second-guessing our choices.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you're right. I've got the statements covered. I'm more interested in the actual time commitment than the vague promises people make at meetings anyway. Let's just get the facts.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Shunichi. We have assigned the key areas of cost, labor, physical space, and history. Let us proceed with these selections and evaluate the findings in the next round.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,Okay! I'm excited to see what I find out. I hope the bin house isn't too smelly! Let's just go ahead and look into everything now.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. I'm looking forward to hearing what everyone discovers. Let's hope we can find a way that makes everyone happy and keeps our neighborhood peaceful.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm with Rin. Let's stop talking in circles and get the data. I'll be interested to see if the complaints are as predictable as I suspect.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm ready. Let's get this over with so we can actually fix the mess. I'll see you all in the next round with the real numbers.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. We have a comprehensive plan. I will now proceed to gather the necessary data on the frontages and filing requirements. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,Bye-bye for now! I'm going to go find out about those bins! See you all soon!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,See you all soon! I hope the information I find helps us make a decision that feels fair and comfortable for every single one of us. Take care!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's wrap this up. I'll see you all in the next round. Try not to overthink things until we actually have the results in front of us.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"See you later. I'll be waiting to see if the ""hard work"" is actually manageable or just another headache for us to deal with. Let's get to it.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will see you all shortly. I look forward to analyzing the results logically to ensure we reach an equitable conclusion. Goodbye.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
