60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I don't like the ""police"" idea, but the bin house is too stinky and I don't want anyone to be sad about money! I'll vote for A because it's not smelly!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried about the cost of the structure and the fairness of the location, but A seems the most balanced for our budgets. I'll vote for A to keep things peaceful.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, I agree. B is physically impossible for some, and C is just a fancy way to start new fights over cleaning and money. A is annoying, but it's the safest bet. I vote A.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I hate the idea of being the neighborhood police at dawn, but B is a physical impossibility and C is a money pit. A is the least worst. I vote A.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"The data is clear. Rotation is physically impossible for some frontages, and a structure is too costly and administratively complex. Despite the labor burden, Option A is the only viable choice. I vote A.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"Since we all agree, I feel much better. Let's just make sure we're kind to each other when we set up the schedule for the supervised hours.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
