68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, agreed. As long as we don't take the ""supervision"" part too seriously and keep it flexible, we can avoid the usual drama. I'm glad we reached a consensus quickly.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
