70,3,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, exactly. Let's just agree now that we won't be too strict with each other. If we keep it chill, maybe it won't be such a headache. I'm over.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, flexibility is important, but we must maintain a clear system to ensure the burden remains equal. I am satisfied that we have reached a logical consensus. I am over.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm glad we all agree! Let's just be super nice to each other so nobody gets grumpy. I'm over!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
